1
00:00:00,196 --> 00:00:02,866
(Sheldon:)let a barn spider
lay eggs in your nose.

2
00:00:04,968 --> 00:00:07,638
(Sheldon:)The minute you sneeze web,
I'm moving out.

3
00:00:07,637 --> 00:00:10,167
(Leonard:)I never thought
I'd say these words,

4
00:00:10,173 --> 00:00:12,243
but come on, nose spider!

5
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,010
(Penny:)Who are you kidding?

6
00:00:15,011 --> 00:00:16,311
(Penny:)You were so panicked

7
00:00:16,312 --> 00:00:18,012
(Penny:)Leonard was gonna die,
you'll never leave him.

8
00:00:18,014 --> 00:00:19,984
(Amy:)Sheldon will move out
eventually.

9
00:00:19,983 --> 00:00:22,383
(Penny:)Yeah, once he figures out
how to work a door.

10
00:00:23,653 --> 00:00:27,493
(Sheldon:)I was not panicked, and I am
not overly attached to Leonard.

11
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:29,560
(Leonard:)You were so worried
that you smashed your face

12
00:00:29,559 --> 00:00:30,829
(Leonard:)trying to check on me.

13
00:00:30,827 --> 00:00:32,227
You love me.

14
00:00:33,329 --> 00:00:34,829
SHELDON:
Yeah. Tell me

15
00:00:34,831 --> 00:00:36,401
(Sheldon:)those aren't the
words of a man

16
00:00:36,399 --> 00:00:38,369
(Sheldon:)with a spider eating its
way through his brain.

17
00:00:38,368 --> 00:00:41,198
(Sheldon:)Amy, you're a neuroscientist.

18
00:00:41,204 --> 00:00:43,574
(Sheldon:)Crack his skull open,
spray some Raid in there.

19
00:00:46,509 --> 00:00:48,709
(Bernadette:)I love that you take pride
in your looks,

20
00:00:48,711 --> 00:00:49,741
(Bernadette:)even when I have

21
00:00:49,746 --> 00:00:51,216
(Bernadette:)to pee in the morning,

22
00:00:51,214 --> 00:00:54,014
(Bernadette:)and you're in there
spending an hour on your hair.

23
00:00:54,017 --> 00:00:58,517
(Howard:)I love that you're too good
to pee in the kitchen sink.

